  "bio": "Milyu Koskin is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Lisbon, Portugal, renowned for their exceptional talent in creating fineline and minimalist tattoos. Their work is steeped in anachronism and inspired by old tales, exemplifying a unique fusion of history and artistry with every meticulously crafted design. Clients value Milyu for their consummate professionalism, ensuring each tattoo experience is not only artistic but also held to the highest standards of care and precision.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lisbon, Portugal\n\n𓆸 @milyukos\nAPR: Laus, Lyon, Paris, Brus, Amst - fully booked\nMAY: Hels 22-23, Sthlm 25-26, Oslo, Cph \nfrom Crimea - Ukraine’s area occupied by rusia",
